    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superior family residence situated on a quiet cul-de-sac in a highly desirable location within walking distance of Skibbereen town and adjacent to the secondary school. This is a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptional home in a peaceful yet convenient setting.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2005 and finished to a high standard throughout, the property extends to approximately 3,500 sq ft. It has been thoughtfully designed to provide bright, spacious and contemporary living accommodation. Boasting six generously proportioned bedrooms, four of which are ensuite, the well laid-out interior offers excellent flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe property has an impressive B2 BER rating and benefits from solar panels, enhancing its energy efficiency and reducing running costs. \r\n\r\nSet on approximately 0.75 acres, the grounds are predominantly laid out in lawn, with gravelled driveway and bordered by mature hedging, providing privacy and ample outdoor space. The property also includes a large detached shed, offering excellent storage or potential for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional home would make an ideal family residence, combining tranquillity and privacy with the convenience of being within easy reach of Skibbereen town centre and its excellent range of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and other amenities. \r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area: 6.8m x 4.7m. \r\nFitted kitchen with integrated appliances. \r\n\r\nLiving Room: 4.5m x 4.1m. \r\n\r\nGym/Office: 5.0m x 4.6m. \r\n\r\nSunroom: 4.0m x 2.6m. \r\n\r\nBedroom 5: 5.0m x 4.5m.  \r\n\r\nEnsuite: 2.1m x 1.6m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 6: 5.1m x 4.5m.\r\n\r\nEnsuite:  2.5m x 1.6m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.5m x 2.0m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: 3.7m x 3.5m. \r\nTiled, plumbed for washing machine & dryer. \r\n\r\nStore: 4.6m x 3.0m. \r\nPlumbed for sink.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 6.8m x 5.0m. \r\n\r\nEnsuite Bathroom: 4.6m x 3.0m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin, bath & shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.4m x 3.9m. \r\n\r\nEnsuite: 2.2m x 2.2m. \r\nWc, wash hand basin & shower. \r\n\r\nWardrobe 2.3m x 2.2m. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 4.3m x 3.8m.\r\n \r\nBedroom 4: 4.1m x 3.8m. \r\n\r\nWc: 2.5m x 1.1m. \r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nDetached shed: 14m x 9m\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nWell water\r\nSeptic tank sewerage disposal\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nSolar panels\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: B2\r\nBER No: 112247218\r\nEPI: 109.68 kWh/m2/yr\r\n\r\nTitle:\r\nFreehold"
      },
